  "summary": "libxml2 through 2.15.4 contains a heap use-after-free vulnerability that allows attackers to crash applications by…",
  "details": "libxml2 through 2.15.4 contains a heap use-after-free vulnerability that allows attackers to crash applications by triggering xmlFreeNode on a stale reader->faketext node after xmlTextReader reuse. Attackers can supply XML containing a namespace declaration to applications that read its value and reuse the reader, causing a freed document's dictionary read and process crash.",
